## Summary

Adds a bounded developer-machine self-update path for the installed Chat Agent Platform without changing the six-tool Chat authority surface.

Concrete problem reproduced on target Windows: the persistent installed runtime was sourced from a very stale local checkout while exact qualification worktrees were current. Refreshing ChatGPT actions therefore re-read an old local `procedure_run` schema. This PR removes the ordinary user checkout from routine update authority.

The user-facing UX is intentionally one action in the existing tray:

`Дополнительно -> Обновить`

One click always checks accepted `main` first. If the installed exact accepted-main SHA is already current, no bootstrap runs and the tray reports `Обновление не требуется. Установлена последняя версия.` If a newer fast-forward `main` exists, it is installed immediately. There is no separate check button, confirmation dialog, updater window, or updater desktop shortcut.

## Stage Research

Decision: **NARROW**. Full rationale and failure matrix are in `project-context/MAIN_SELF_UPDATE_RESEARCH.md`.

Selected boundary:

- source is fixed to `BogdanAIP/chat-agent-platform` `main` only;
- private bare Git cache under `%LOCALAPPDATA%\ChatAgentPlatform\update-cache`;
- atomic fetch of exact `main` ref;
- exact detached + clean update worktree;
- known installed SHA must be an ancestor of target, otherwise fail closed (no remote rollback/non-fast-forward update);
- one named updater mutex;
- canonical `bootstrap-chat-platform.ps1` remains the only installer;
- exact installed-main receipt is published/reconciled only after successful bootstrap and only from clean exact official `origin/main`;
- tray integration is a thin dedicated helper and reuses the existing lifecycle-busy projection so Start/Stop, double-click toggles, mode changes, tray exit, and updater installation cannot race;
- release-grade package distribution / whole-install rollback remains Stage 27 and is not claimed here.

## Source-code research

Reviewed exact public implementations:

- `microsoft/vscode@359cba2f0b72a099db9d2fa502de4a2f09894908`, `src/vs/platform/update/electron-main/updateService.win32.ts`: keep separation of check/stage/verify/apply; do not port its Squirrel package framework.
- `desktop/desktop@3b3cd0cecf75530d83285f494a9aba0aecf96030`, `app/src/ui/lib/update-store.ts`: keep explicit updater state; do not port Electron updater machinery.

## Files

- `scripts/chat-platform-update-core.ps1` — Git/source/state primitives.
- `scripts/chat-platform-update.ps1` — public fixed-source `Check|Update` wrapper; tray invokes only `Update`.
- `scripts/chat-platform-tray-update.ps1` — one-click tray adapter and notifications.
- `scripts/chat-platform-tray.ps1` — thin `Дополнительно -> Обновить` registration and safe-exit integration.
- `scripts/bootstrap-chat-platform.ps1` — ships updater assets and records successful exact-main install identity.
- `tests/test_chat_platform_update.py` — source/tray contracts plus real local-Git fast-forward/rollback/worktree tests when `pwsh`+`git` are present.
- `project-context/MAIN_SELF_UPDATE_RESEARCH.md` — governing narrow research brief.

## Exact-head physical qualification

Final qualified PR head:

`4d83e5423e7c692d98844cc7cb52bbfb2b575122`

Accepted update target during qualification:

`main@90a8e16e6a1badecd3315968339ca691634b7ee4`

Target-Windows evidence:

- starting installed runtime was stale and lacked `independent_review_procedures.py` / `independent_review_state.py`;
- first physical update installed exact accepted `main`, passed canonical bootstrap smoke, published `platform-update.json` with `status=current`, and restarted the six-tool runtime;
- first attempt exposed a real terminal-handoff defect: updater stdout/stderr pipe inheritance by long-lived restarted descendants could keep the updater/tray waiting after successful installation;
- exact-head fix moved tray completion to an atomic `platform-update-result.json` and restarted the installed manager without pipe capture;
- controlled full-path rerun on the fixed head forced the accepted-main bootstrap + restart path again and completed normally with tray notification `Установлена версия 90a8e16e`;
- durable result reported `status=updated`, exact installed SHA `90a8e16e...`, and `restarted=true`;
- updater process terminated normally and tray returned from `Обновление...` to `Обновить`;
- immediate second click took the no-op path and reported `Обновление не требуется. Установлена последняя версия.` without another bootstrap;
- installed accepted-main runtime remained running with the reviewer backend files present.

