## Acceptance remaining

This remains Draft. Remaining merge gates:

1. mandatory fresh ordinary-ChatGPT semantic review under BASE `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/skills/code-review/SKILL.md` v1.1 for exact `BASE=90a8e16e6a1badecd3315968339ca691634b7ee4` / `HEAD=4d83e5423e7c692d98844cc7cb52bbfb2b575122`;
2. validate every reported finding as `CONFIRMED / REJECTED / SUPERSEDED` and fix any confirmed issue; any material fix requires fresh review and affected acceptance reruns;
3. final live BASE/HEAD re-resolution and exact-head gate recheck before merge.

No change to PR #149 or its exact-head Agent Session L3 evidence.
